  "worked_solution": "We apply the product rule for radicals, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{3ab}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{5b} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{3ab\\cdot 5b} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{15a{b}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
